WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:27.128
Tom and Cat moved into the palace.

2
00:00:27.129 --> 00:00:37.902
Tom was the royal wizard now.

3
00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:41.407
But there was not much to do.

4
00:00:41.408 --> 00:01:08.151
"Let's go to the Royal Kitchen," Cat said.

5
00:01:08.152 --> 00:01:22.952
Cook gave Tom and Cat snacks.

6
00:01:22.953 --> 00:01:32.092
Cat chased some mice.

7
00:01:32.093 --> 00:01:38.264
But soon Tom and Cat were bored.

8
00:01:38.265 --> 00:01:47.056
"Let's go to the Royal Lab," Tom said.

9
00:01:47.057 --> 00:01:56.758
Tom mixed some potions.

10
00:01:56.759 --> 00:01:59.643
He practiced some magic spells.

11
00:01:59.644 --> 00:02:06.837
"Bring Cat a fish!" Poof!

12
00:02:06.838 --> 00:02:10.898
"That's a fishing rod!" Tom moaned.

13
00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:13.932
"What am I going to do, Cat?

14
00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:17.288
My spells never work.

15
00:02:17.289 --> 00:02:22.629
One day the king and queen will need my magic."

16
00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:27.435
Cat licked her paws.

17
00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:34.866
"You have a kind heart, Tom," she said.

18
00:02:34.867 --> 00:02:38.196
Days and weeks passed.

19
00:02:38.197 --> 00:02:48.439
Still no one at the palace needed magic.

20
00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.963
Bam! Bam!

21
00:02:50.964 --> 00:02:58.294
One night someone pounded hard on Tom's door.

22
00:02:58.295 --> 00:03:02.290
"Get up, Wizard!" a voice growled.

23
00:03:02.291 --> 00:03:07.863
It was Dirk. "Go to the moat at once!"

24
00:03:07.864 --> 00:03:13.466
"The moat?" Tom leaped out of bed.

25
00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:21.336
"I'm coming!"

26
00:03:21.337 --> 00:03:28.762
He put on his royal robe.

27
00:03:28.763 --> 00:03:33.551
"Where is my royal wand?" he asked.

28
00:03:33.552 --> 00:03:37.923
"It's in your hand," Cat said.

29
00:03:37.924 --> 00:03:40.408
"Oops," Tom said.

30
00:03:40.409 --> 00:03:43.307
At last Tom was ready.

31
00:03:43.308 --> 00:03:46.019
"See you later, Cat!" Tom said.

32
00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:52.622
"Good luck," Cat said.

33
00:03:52.623 --> 00:03:54.977
She went back to sleep.

34
00:03:54.978 --> 00:04:00.995
And Tom left for the moat.

